WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,920
Xu Rouer, Ye Mianmian, Wu Yunxi, you three, go ahead

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:03,960
Pay attention to safety on the road

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,160
Where is Lu Shu Tang?

4
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,360
Isn't he already gone?

5
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,560
My legs are faster than anyone else

6
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,780
Why did you come alone?

7
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:14,900
Xu Rouer said you should come up to me.

8
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:22,770
Song Shulin, do you regret that moment?

9
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,250
You know what I mean about no regrets

10
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:27,170
But I don’t want to worry about food and drink

11
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:28,210
Just do that kind of thing

12
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:29,330
Then don’t use words like eating

13
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:32,700
Relationships are relationships, transactions are transactions, it’s true

14
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,300
I used to make you work in exchange for food

15
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,820
It's because you can't bring anything else of value

16
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,140
I'm not asking you to use yourself as a commodity

17
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:45,800
Well, I wanted to come here today. I know I can get here today.

18
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,500
It seems you can't hide it today
